    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Psst, wanna join the Rat Race?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>This is Rattus VELOCITAS,</strong></i> <strong><i>an arcade racing game where Fancy Rats riding futuristic ion-engine powered hoverbikes race on procedurally generated race courses! Collect items to give yourself an advantage or take out the competition in this high speed rodent frenzy!</i></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 different procedurally generated environment types.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 Different items, including Missiles, a Shield, a piece of Cheese and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With 3 ways to start races, play to maximise your performance ratio or always gun for pole position!\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 different Fancy Rat colours and patterns you can choose from aside from the default Lab Rat colour, including Black-Eyed White, Agouti Hooded, and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game can be played in Splitscreen with up to 4 players on one PC!*</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Please note that multiple game controllers, including Xbox 360, Xbox One, Dualshock 4(R) or DualSense(R) controllers are required for Splitscreen multiplayer mode. Performance depending on the machine hardware configuration may be reduced in Splitscreen.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Psst, wanna join the Rat Race?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>This is Rattus VELOCITAS,</strong></i> <strong><i>an arcade racing game where Fancy Rats riding futuristic ion-engine powered hoverbikes race on procedurally generated race courses! Collect items to give yourself an advantage or take out the competition in this high speed rodent frenzy!</i></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 different procedurally generated environment types.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 Different items, including Missiles, a Shield, a piece of Cheese and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With 3 ways to start races, play to maximise your performance ratio or always gun for pole position!\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 different Fancy Rat colours and patterns you can choose from aside from the default Lab Rat colour, including Black-Eyed White, Agouti Hooded, and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game can be played in Splitscreen with up to 4 players on one PC!*</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Please note that multiple game controllers, including Xbox 360, Xbox One, Dualshock 4(R) or DualSense(R) controllers are required for Splitscreen multiplayer mode. Performance depending on the machine hardware configuration may be reduced in Splitscreen.</p>",
